# DVC
# NOTE: do NOT ignore dvc.lock, dvc.yaml, params.yaml, .dvc/config, or any
# `cache: false` metrics/plots files declared in dvc.yaml (e.g.
# data/dataset_stats.json, metrics/*.json, metrics/*.csv) -- those are meant
# to be committed to Git so `dvc metrics diff`/`dvc params diff` can compare
# them across commits. Large/binary DVC outputs (raw audio, checkpoints,
# generated .wav files, ...) stay cached by DVC and excluded from Git above.
/.dvc/cache

